    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d232">

                <pb facs="0400" n="312" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg312"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/3013</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1072</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-26">November 26,
                            1918</date>.<lb/>[Received December 14.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith
                    translation of a letter received yesterday from Dr. Viogian Antonio, “Syndic of
                    the Free City of Fiume and its District,” and Dr. Antoni, “Delegate of the
                    National Council,” which letter deals briefly with the history of and present
                    status of conditions in the City of Fiume.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thos. Nelson Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d232-a1.xml" xpointer="d232-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
